{{WeaponInfoboxAutomatic}}
{{Codex|Annihilate targets with four simultaneous shots from this high-caliber Grineer rifle.}}

The '''Quartakk''' is a {{Faction|Grineer}} quad-barreled heavy burst rifle that fires 4 bullets simultaneously in a single burst. Its slow [[fire rate]] is compensated by possessing very high burst damage, high [[accuracy]] and [[status chance]], and good [[critical chance]].

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Impact}} damage.
*Innate 0.5 meter [[punch through]].
*Uniquely fires all four shots simultaneously instead of consecutively, reducing the chance of one missing.
*Innate two {{Pol|Madurai}} polarities.

{{Advantages|class=Rifle|trigger=Burst|
*Tied with {{Weapon|Kuva Quartakk}} for the second highest [[status chance]] of all burst-fire rifles, behind {{Weapon|Paracyst}}/{{Weapon|Burston Prime}}.
*Largest magazine size of all burst-fire rifles.
}}

{{Disadvantages|class=Rifle|trigger=Burst|
*Linearly less efficient &ndash; sometimes a target may only die with five bullets, which requires an entire second burst to be fired.
*Each shot lands in a small square formation around where the user is aiming instead of directly on the crosshair, which may lead to misses against smaller targets.
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Kuva Quartakk}}
{{Clr}}
{{Acquisition|The Quartakk's blueprint can be acquired as a reward from performing special Ghoul Purge [[Bounties]], or dropped by [[Ghoul Auger|Ghoul Auger Alphas]]. The built weapon can also be bought from the [[Market]] individually, or as part of the [[Maggor Assault Pack]].}}
{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}
This weapon can be sold for {{cc|7,500}}. The blueprint for this weapon can be sold for {{cc|2,500}}.

==Trivia==
*The name Quartakk may be derived from the Latin word ''Quartus'', meaning "fourth," a reference to the weapon's four barrels.
*Prior to {{ver|22.9}}, the Quartakk functioned as a semi-automatic rifle that fired four bullets per shot. This caused the weapon's [[status chance]] to behave similarly to [[Status_Effect#Multishot|multi-pellet shotguns]], in that the listed status chance was split between each bullet. After the update, the Quartakk was changed into a burst-fire rifle firing four bullets simultaneously, resulting in each bullet having the listed status chance instead of being split.
**Despite {{ver|27.2}}'s changes to status multishot properly listing status per projectile, Quartakk is still labeled as a burst rifle.

